+
+### Changing the runner
+
+Editing only the runner metadata in Cargo.toml regenerates the test files
+and selects that runner on the next rust-js test invocation. Rust source
+need not change and no clean build is required. The settings manifest is
+a recorded build input for Cargo and standalone compiles alike (#1751).
